      ],
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Welcome to Rabanastre, the capital city of Dalmasca. After the opening sequence, you'll find yourself in Lowtown with Vaan. This is your first opportunity to explore the city and prepare for the adventure ahead."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Make sure to visit the shops in the Sandsea area. Stock up on Potions and Phoenix Downs - you'll need them soon. The weapon and armor shops offer basic equipment that will help you survive the early game battles."
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Take time to speak with NPCs to learn about the Clan system and accept your first hunts. The Clan Primer is essential for tracking your progress with Elite Marks."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt01b": {
      "code": "wt01b",
      "kind": "loot",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "オルラン号の密書",
          "en": "Loot Alert: Clan Primer",
          "raw": "Loot Alert: Clan Primer"
        }
      },
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "MISSABLE! Before leaving Rabanastre for the first time, make sure to obtain the Clan Primer from the Sandsea tavern. Speak to Montblanc to receive it. This item is essential for tracking hunts."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt01c": {
      "code": "wt01c",
      "kind": "mark",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "討伐依頼：レッドウルフ",
          "en": "Hunt: Red Wolf",
          "raw": "Hunt: Red Wolf"
        }
      },
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Your first hunt! Red Wolf can be found in the Dalmasca Estersand. It's weak to Ice, so stock up on Blizzard if you've purchased it. The hunt is optional but recommended for early Gil and experience."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt02a": {
      "code": "wt02a",
      "kind": "story",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "ガラムサイズ水路",
          "en": "Garamsythe Waterway",
          "raw": "Garamsythe Waterway"
        }
      },
      "crystals": {
        "save": true
      },
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Garamsythe Waterway is a maze-like dungeon beneath Rabanastre. Follow the main path and be prepared for battles with Steeling and Dire Rats. Make sure to save at the crystal point before proceeding deeper."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt02b": {
      "code": "wt02b",
      "kind": "loot",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "見逃せないアイテム",
          "en": "Loot Alert: Waterway Treasures",
          "raw": "Loot Alert: Waterway Treasures"
        }
      },
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Several chests in the Waterway contain valuable items. Don't miss the chest in the No. 11 Channel that contains a valuable Potion cache. Some chests are hidden behind pillars."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt03a": {
      "code": "wt03a",
      "kind": "story",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "ダルマスカ砂漠",
          "en": "Dalmasca Estersand",
          "raw": "Dalmasca Estersand"
        }
      },
      "crystals": {
        "teleport": true,
        "save": true
      },
      "shops": [
        {
          "name": "Item Shop",
          "items": [
            {
              "itemId": "item_potion",
              "nameJp": "ポーション",
              "nameEn": "Potion",
              "nameRaw": "Potion",
              "price": 70
            },
            {
              "itemId": "item_hi_potion",
              "nameJp": "ハイポーション",
              "nameEn": "Hi-Potion",
              "nameRaw": "Hi-Potion",
              "price": 210
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Estersand is your first real outdoor area. Watch out for Wolves and Cockatrices. The weather can change here, affecting enemy spawns and behavior. This is also where you'll find your first hunt target."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wt03b": {
      "code": "wt03b",
      "kind": "mark",
      "titles": {
        "primary": {
          "jp": "討伐依頼：トマト",
          "en": "Hunt: Rogue Tomato",
          "raw": "Hunt: Rogue Tomato"
        }
      },
      "narrative": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The infamous Rogue Tomato! Located in the Estersand, this hunt is trickier than it looks. Use physical attacks and avoid magic - it's resistant to most elements. Good luck!"
        }
      ]
    },
